msgid ""
"Identifier of the access-point adapter the company uses for inbound poll and"
" outbound submit. Defaults to 'manual', which means the deployment routes "
"XML by file drop / email / portal upload. Set this to one of the registered "
"adapter keys to enable live AS4 transport (install the corresponding ERP "
"Heritage adapter module first)."
msgstr ""
"Pengenal adaptor access-point yang digunakan perusahaan untuk polling masuk "
"dan pengiriman keluar. Default 'manual', yang berarti penerapan merutekan "
"XML melalui file drop / email / unggah portal. Setel ke salah satu kunci "
"adaptor terdaftar untuk mengaktifkan transport AS4 langsung (instal modul "
"adaptor ERP Heritage yang sesuai terlebih dahulu)."

